CORE
template-names.sh
--resolve-dynamic-sites
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^Dynamic sites: 2 resolved, 0 unreachable, 0 unresolved \(2 rounds\)$
^\[shell-dynamic-site\.1\] .* \*"_run": SUCCESS$
^\[assertion\.1\] .* = yes: SUCCESS$
^\[shell-dynamic-site\.2\] .* "kde"\*"-config": SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A command name whose candidates are templates: the functions and
builtins whose names they match get branches, and other names they match
run a utility.
